   <td><a target="_blank" href="/news/29/ginkou/20180302-2.html">Figures regarding suspended repayments following the earthquake in the Kumamoto region (as of December 31, 2017)&nbsp;</a><img alt="open new window" class="newwin" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;" src="/en/images/common/icon_newwin.gif"><br><span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&lt; </span>Summary<span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&gt;</span><br>
