   <td><a target="_blank" href="/news/29/syouken/20180309.html">The seventh trial of an administrative penalty case against Areion Asset Management Company Limited for market manipulation of stocks of NITTO DENKO CORPORATION</a><img alt="open new window" class="newwin" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;" src="/en/images/common/icon_newwin.gif"><br><span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&lt; </span>Summary<span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&gt;</span><br>
