   <td><a href="/news/29/syouken/20180302-1.html" target="_blank">Administrative action against Growth Advisors Co., Ltd. (The Kanto Local Finance Bureau)</a><img alt="open new window" class="newwin" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;" src="/en/images/common/icon_newwin.gif"><br><span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&lt; </span>Summary<span lang="EN-US" new="" style="font-family:;" times="">&gt;</span><br>
     On March 2, 2018, the Kanto Local Finance Bureau took an administrative action against Growth Advisors Co., Ltd., ordering the improvement of its business operations pursuant to the “Financial Instruments and Exchange Act.” This administrative action is based on a recommendation from the Securities and Exchange Surveillance Commission (SESC) as a result of its on-site inspection.</td>
